# Docker images are self-contained for deployment, but only the paths copied by
# Dockerfile belong in the build context. Custom/OCA add-ons and user docs are
# mounted by Compose; private dumps, filestores and repository metadata must
# never be transferred to the builder.
*

!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile
!MANIFEST.in
!odoo-bin
!requirements.txt
!setup.py

!addons/
!addons/**
!debian/
!debian/odoo.conf
!docker/
!docker/**
!odoo/
!odoo/**
!setup/
!setup/**

# The qualified distribution stage embeds the delivered add-ons, their exact
# patched OCA sources, and user documentation. Private migration inputs and
# generated evidence remain excluded by the deny-by-default rule above.
!custom-addons/
!custom-addons/**
!oca-addons/
!oca-addons/**
!oca-src/
!oca-src/**
oca-src/**/.git
oca-src/**/.git/**
!docs/
!docs/users/
!docs/users/**
